1
00:00:04,246 --> 00:00:05,916
(Leonard:)Sheldon, dinner's here.

2
00:00:06,081 --> 00:00:07,411
SHELDON:
Tandoori Palace?

3
00:00:07,583 --> 00:00:09,293
(Leonard:)No, we went somewhere new.

4
00:00:12,963 --> 00:00:15,633
(Sheldon:)You're good-naturedly ribbing me,
aren't you?

5
00:00:16,091 --> 00:00:17,761
(Leonard:)No, look, Mumbai Palace.

6
00:00:17,926 --> 00:00:20,346
(Sheldon:)Why? Why would we change?

7
00:00:20,554 --> 00:00:25,264
(Sheldon:)We had a perfectly good palace.
Tandoori Palace is our palace.

8
00:00:25,434 --> 00:00:27,814
(Leonard:)Trust me, this will be just fine.

9
00:00:27,978 --> 00:00:30,268
(Howard:)You are the authority on just fine.

10
00:00:30,439 --> 00:00:32,609
[BOTH CHUCKLING]

11
00:00:32,774 --> 00:00:35,064
(Leonard:)What's that supposed to mean?

12
00:00:35,277 --> 00:00:37,697
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)Exactly. Not bad, but not great.

13
00:00:37,863 --> 00:00:39,073
[BOTH CHUCKLING]

14
00:00:40,282 --> 00:00:42,452
(Penny:)-What are they talking about?
-I don't know.

15
00:00:42,618 --> 00:00:46,078
(Sheldon:)-I know. As I'm sure you're aware--
-Dut! Dut-dut-dut-dut!

16
00:00:46,455 --> 00:00:49,125
(Sheldon:)If that's Morse code, that's terrible.

17
00:00:49,875 --> 00:00:53,335
(Sheldon:)As I was saying, you and Leonard
had a disappointing sexual encounter.

18
00:00:53,503 --> 00:00:56,633
(Sheldon:)Earlier this evening,
Leonard characterized it as, "Just fine."

19
00:00:56,798 --> 00:01:03,018
So, what you're seeing is a continuation
of the mocking that followed.

